#. module: l10n_iq
# Auto-completed for GlobalCloud GPC zh_CN coverage.
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_iq.demo_company_iq
msgid ""
"IQ Company undertakes to do its best to supply performant services in due "
"time in accordance with the agreed timeframes. However, none of its "
"obligations can be considered as being an obligation to achieve results. IQ "
"Company cannot under any circumstances, be required by the client to appear "
"as a third party in the context of any claim for damages filed against the "
"client by an end consumer."
msgstr ""
"IQ 公司 undertakes to do its best to supply performant services in due time in"
" accordance with the agreed timeframes. However, none of its obligations can"
" be considered as being an obligation to achieve results. IQ 公司 cannot under"
" any circumstances, be 必填 by the client to appear as a third party in the "
"context of any claim for damages filed against the client by an end "
"consumer."

#. module: l10n_iq
# Auto-completed for GlobalCloud GPC zh_CN coverage.
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_iq.demo_company_iq
msgid ""
"If a payment is still outstanding more than sixty (60) days after the due "
"payment date, IQ Company reserves the right to call on the services of a "
"debt recovery company. All legal expenses will be payable by the client."
msgstr ""
"If a 付款 is still outstanding more than sixty (60) days after the due 付款 日期, "
"IQ 公司 reserves the right to call on the services of a debt recovery 公司. All "
"legal expenses will be payable by the client."

#. module: l10n_iq
# Auto-completed for GlobalCloud GPC zh_CN coverage.
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_iq.demo_company_iq
msgid ""
"In order for it to be admissible, IQ Company must be notified of any claim "
"by means of a letter sent by recorded delivery to its registered office "
"within 8 days of the delivery of the goods or the provision of the services."
msgstr ""
"In 订单 for it to be admissible, IQ 公司 must be notified of any claim by means "
"of a letter 已发送 by recorded 交货 to its registered office within 8 days of the"
" 交货 of the goods or the provision of the services."

#. module: l10n_iq
# Auto-completed for GlobalCloud GPC zh_CN coverage.
#: model_terms:res.company,invoice_terms_html:l10n_iq.demo_company_iq
msgid ""
"Our invoices are payable within 21 working days, unless another payment "
"timeframe is indicated on either the invoice or the order. In the event of "
"non-payment by the due date, IQ Company reserves the right to request a "
"fixed interest payment amounting to 10% of the sum remaining due. IQ Company"
" will be authorized to suspend any provision of services without prior "
"warning in the event of late payment."
msgstr ""
"Our 发票 are payable within 21 working days, unless another 付款 timeframe is "
"indicated on either the 发票 or the 订单. In the 活动 of non-payment by the 到期日, "
"IQ 公司 reserves the right to 请求 a fixed interest 付款 amounting to 10% of the "
"sum remaining due. IQ 公司 will be authorized to suspend any provision of "
"services without prior 警告 in the 活动 of late 付款."

